  "scope": "10 consecutive screenshot translation rounds with result-window target language switching (all 10 languages), plus 2 realtime hide rounds",
  "fixes": [
    "Main window bypasses the Windows/DWM hide fade via setOpacity(0) before hide and setOpacity(1) before restore.",
    "Result window header adds a 10-language target picker; switching persists targetLang and retranslates in place.",
    "Result window now shows the latest record after page load (fixes a stale OCR-state overwrite race).",
    "Realtime stop while the region overlay is open now cancels the overlay instead of leaving selecting=true (fixes next start returning busy).",
    "CJK target detection reads record.meta.targetLang (previously always undefined).",
    "action:set-target no longer starts a new selection when OCR is still pending; it only persists the target."
  ],
